              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wonti AABBO Waaqi guddaani jed'u tana: Anini worra Yerusalemu waan hamtu afuri ka worra balleesa iti erga — woraana, beela, bineensa ala, d'ukuba — aka namaafi saale ch'ufa akuma takaa balleesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
